        "heading": "Which company holds the largest federal contract in FY2026 to date?",
        "body": "HUMANA GOVERNMENT BUSINESS INC holds the largest federal contract at $51.3B. That figure is the full contract value, not the amount obligated this fiscal year. The ranking lists total award values, so the largest entry equals the listed total obligations figure, $51.3B."
      },
      {
        "heading": "How is the top-ten list composed by industry type?",
        "body": "The top ten includes health plan administration, traditional defense primes, and national laboratory managers. Examples are HUMANA GOVERNMENT BUSINESS INC at $51.3B, LOCKHEED MARTIN CORP at $48.1B, and NATIONAL TECHNOLOGY & ENGINEERING SOLUTIONS OF SANDIA, LLC at $42.6B. Several entries are national laboratory managers such as UT-BATTELLE LLC at $42.1B and LAWRENCE LIVERMORE NATIONAL SECURITY, LLC at $41.2B."
